# No trailing slashes: a trailing slash matches directories ONLY, and every agent working in
# a git worktree symlinks `node_modules` in from the main checkout. That symlink is a FILE, so
# `node_modules/` did not ignore it and one got committed (mode 120000) — after which every
# checkout of that commit tries to lay a self-referential symlink over the real directory.
node_modules
dist
coverage
api-docs
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
.claude/
